{input:"M002",at:"S002",bindings:"R₀=ℤ, S₀=R, A=M, Γ=I, source B=m; apply for each i∈I.",hypothesis_checks:["ℤ is a commutative ring and M is an abelian group, hence a ℤ-module.","S001 proved R is a subring of ℚ; the integer inclusion supplies its ℤ-algebra structure.","The chosen m is a ℤ-basis of M indexed by I by F001."]},
